        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3203160/extras/1acbe6cc711b134ed34daae63f4e729e.poster.avif?t=1761595430\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3203160/extras/1acbe6cc711b134ed34daae63f4e729e.webm?t=1761595430\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3203160/extras/1acbe6cc711b134ed34daae63f4e729e.mp4?t=1761595430\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Talk to Me Human</strong> throws you into awkward social situations that you must talk your way out of. Literally. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play by speaking. Will you fool the NPCs by spinning tall tales, or take the honest approach?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3203160/extras/4387831392867664cd1882a92312f399.poster.avif?t=1761595430\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3203160/extras/4387831392867664cd1882a92312f399.webm?t=1761595430\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3203160/extras/4387831392867664cd1882a92312f399.mp4?t=1761595430\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Missed your friend's birthday? Skipped work? Or maybe your roommate just needs a chat? Try your hand at dozens of conversational challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3203160/extras/120f02d9a92edbba0ccd738bc195db91.poster.avif?t=1761595430\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3203160/extras/120f02d9a92edbba0ccd738bc195db91.webm?t=1761595430\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3203160/extras/120f02d9a92edbba0ccd738bc195db91.mp4?t=1761595430\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your microphone to play. Fully-voiced characters &quot;think&quot; and reply dynamically to what you say. Their AIs are smart enough to play along, and won't let obvious lies slip through. But you're probably smarter than an AI.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3203160/extras/0785c80a95490378e275b57f6362fa5f.poster.avif?t=1761595430\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3203160/extras/0785c80a95490378e275b57f6362fa5f.webm?t=1761595430\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3203160/extras/0785c80a95490378e275b57f6362fa5f.mp4?t=1761595430\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Embark on a quirky and lighthearted adventure in an upbeat near-future world. Gain social currency and new powers. Test your AI manipulation with bonus challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Try <strong>Talk to Me Human</strong> to experience conversations in a game like you've never played before.  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Great with friends!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Talk to Me Human</strong> is a single-player game, but taking turns or playing with a crowd is sure to bring laughs.<br><br>Early reviews from Beta players:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;I've never played a game that had me dying laughing like that!&quot;</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;It's unlike any game I've ever played.&quot;</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;Feels like this could be the first of a future of games with a much more interactive form of NPCs.&quot;</strong></p></li></ul>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3203160/extras/1acbe6cc711b134ed34daae63f4e729e.poster.avif?t=1761595430\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3203160/extras/1acbe6cc711b134ed34daae63f4e729e.webm?t=1761595430\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3203160/extras/1acbe6cc711b134ed34daae63f4e729e.mp4?t=1761595430\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Talk to Me Human</strong> throws you into awkward social situations that you must talk your way out of. Literally. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play by speaking. Will you fool the NPCs by spinning tall tales, or take the honest approach?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3203160/extras/4387831392867664cd1882a92312f399.poster.avif?t=1761595430\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3203160/extras/4387831392867664cd1882a92312f399.webm?t=1761595430\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3203160/extras/4387831392867664cd1882a92312f399.mp4?t=1761595430\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Missed your friend's birthday? Skipped work? Or maybe your roommate just needs a chat? Try your hand at dozens of conversational challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3203160/extras/120f02d9a92edbba0ccd738bc195db91.poster.avif?t=1761595430\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3203160/extras/120f02d9a92edbba0ccd738bc195db91.webm?t=1761595430\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3203160/extras/120f02d9a92edbba0ccd738bc195db91.mp4?t=1761595430\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your microphone to play. Fully-voiced characters &quot;think&quot; and reply dynamically to what you say. Their AIs are smart enough to play along, and won't let obvious lies slip through. But you're probably smarter than an AI.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3203160/extras/0785c80a95490378e275b57f6362fa5f.poster.avif?t=1761595430\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3203160/extras/0785c80a95490378e275b57f6362fa5f.webm?t=1761595430\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3203160/extras/0785c80a95490378e275b57f6362fa5f.mp4?t=1761595430\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Embark on a quirky and lighthearted adventure in an upbeat near-future world. Gain social currency and new powers. Test your AI manipulation with bonus challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Try <strong>Talk to Me Human</strong> to experience conversations in a game like you've never played before.  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Great with friends!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Talk to Me Human</strong> is a single-player game, but taking turns or playing with a crowd is sure to bring laughs.<br><br>Early reviews from Beta players:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;I've never played a game that had me dying laughing like that!&quot;</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;It's unlike any game I've ever played.&quot;</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;Feels like this could be the first of a future of games with a much more interactive form of NPCs.&quot;</strong></p></li></ul>",
